    <statement><p>Give a vector parametric equation for the line
through the point <m>\left(-3,4,-3\right)</m> that is parallel
to the line <m>\left\lt 5t-2,4+4t,3-t\right&gt;</m>:
<CENTER/></p>
<p><m>L(t)</m> = <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/>.
</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(-3,4,-3\right)+t\mathopen{}\left&lt;5,4,-1\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
